<title>POLAND: Vistula Q1 net falls to PLN 2.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Vistula Q1 net falls to PLN 2.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vistula preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.24 vs	3.92</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.31 vs	6.54</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.94 vs	4.32</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Vistula SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 28.50 vs     24.76</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  21.55 vs     17.66</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.80 vs	2.35</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.43 vs	0.13</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     7.34 vs     10.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			  6.27 vs	7.41</p>
<p>    investment				 1.06 vs	0.58</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
